{
  "about": "Every day-of feature in hostv2 (the live view, the day before and Afterward), with where it lives in hostv4’s The Day. dayEveryFeatureHasAHome.test.mjs checks each anchor still exists in hostv2, that built and linked features are on hostv4’s DayPage, and that planned ones name their batch. Nothing hostv2 does on the day may drop without this file saying so.",
  "places": {
    "built": "On hostv4’s The Day (or Today’s run, or counter mode)",
    "linked": "A link from The Day to the current app, until it is rebuilt",
    "planned": "Not yet in hostv4; the named batch builds it"
  },
